#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:3
#: 7b294892a45644e993619e7363b79ee2
msgid "FPS 代表性采样（FPS Sampling）"
msgstr "FPS Representative Sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:5
#: fa1002dabdd641b8891f43ad82548af7
msgid "**分类：** 筛选与采样"
msgstr "**Category:** Filtering and sampling"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:7
#: d4db257bf8a74a0d8be46ef905f1be9f
msgid "功能说明"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:9
#: a851fed83e224a05ab88fb5b0d56479b
msgid ""
"从候选池中选择描述符空间里的代表结构，输出数量不超过设定上限。它通常接在 `Geometry Filter` 后面：前者删除明确的几何异常，FPS "
"再减少相似结构，控制进入 DFT 的数量。"
msgstr ""
"Select structures that represent the candidate pool in descriptor space, up to a "
"configured output limit. It usually follows `Geometry Filter`: the first card removes"
" clear geometric anomalies, and FPS then reduces similar structures to control the "
"number sent to DFT."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:11
#: f8436a9b96664dfe990dc90309e9991a
msgid "“代表性”取决于所选 NEP 模型。模型改变后，描述符距离和入选结构也可能改变。"
msgstr ""
"What counts as representative depends on the selected NEP model. Changing the model "
"may change both descriptor distances and the selected structures."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:13
#: 6126378a20634ddab3ee245fb706ed01
msgid "原理与公式"
msgstr "Principles and Equations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:15
#: 184c939b909843b29ed1374c381be259
msgid "先把一个结构中 $N_i$ 个原子的 NEP 描述符取平均："
msgstr "First average the NEP descriptors of the $N_i$ atoms in a structure:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:17
#: 4455f3375c154affbfbc10b9701b8f82
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\mathbf d_i=\\frac{1}{N_i}\\sum_{a=1}^{N_i}\\mathbf d_{ia}^{\\mathrm{NEP}}.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:21
#: 3c425171f9b848588d97d631b487fe45
msgid "FPS 每一步选择离当前已覆盖集合最远的候选："
msgstr "At each step, FPS selects the candidate farthest from the currently covered set:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:23
#: adfe7ff712d3479eb4e94e6ff9b0b6f1
msgid ""
"\n"
"i_t=\\arg\\max_j\\min_{i\\in S_{t-1}}\\lVert\\mathbf d_j-\\mathbf d_i\\rVert_2.\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:27
#: a74e8ded169c4920a2ecbd754cd34755
msgid ""
"若选择“基于已有训练集补选”，已有训练集的描述符会成为初始覆盖集合 $S_0$。FPS 在此基础上挑选离已有覆盖最远的新候选；已有训练集本身不进入本次输出。距离阈值大于 "
"0 时，最远候选仍达不到阈值就提前停止，因此实际输出可能少于上限。"
msgstr ""
"When `Supplement existing set` is selected, descriptors from the existing training "
"set form the initial covered set $S_0$. FPS then chooses new candidates farthest from"
" that coverage; the existing training structures themselves are not included in this "
"output. If the distance cutoff is greater than 0, selection stops when even the "
"farthest candidate does not reach it, so the actual output may be smaller than the "
"limit."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:29
#: 6d86307b4a1c41dc964aca747ed7c117
msgid "操作示例"
msgstr "Example"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:31
#: 42e306d209804c71a11d5d7013ea18a3
msgid "候选池包含 80 个 Si、20 个 Ge 和 40 个 Si–Ge 结构，希望最多选择 30 帧："
msgstr ""
"Suppose a candidate pool contains 80 Si, 20 Ge, and 40 Si–Ge structures, and you want"
" to select at most 30 frames:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:33
#: b9bfcc43763d4c3c9fc598a01c0d2a66
msgid "先用 `Geometry Filter` 删除短键等异常帧。"
msgstr "Use `Geometry Filter` first to remove frames with short bonds or other anomalies."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:34
#: aa510c00cb374a8cb75012630041fcef
msgid "NEP 模型选择覆盖 Si 和 Ge 的模型。"
msgstr "Select a NEP model that covers both Si and Ge."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:35
#: fbef2c0a9a054338befb17b1862450da
msgid "选择“按元素集合均衡”，把最大输出设为 `30`。"
msgstr "Select `Balance by element set` and set maximum output to `30`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:36
#: c7a5b424fc02460fa50d20581280c905
msgid "预览会显示 Si、Ge、Ge+Si 三组的计划名额；元素集合只看出现了哪些元素，不区分 SiGe 与 Si₂Ge 的化学计量。"
msgstr ""
"The preview shows planned quotas for the Si, Ge, and Ge+Si groups. An element set "
"records only which elements are present; it does not distinguish the stoichiometry of"
" SiGe from Si₂Ge."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:37
#: 93e20112f3dd4101a1e5d1d9534d7243
msgid "运行后检查实际输出数和元素集合覆盖。已有训练集或距离阈值可能使某组实际输出为 0，所以计划名额不是结果保证。"
msgstr ""
"After the run, inspect the actual output count and element-set coverage. An existing "
"training set or distance cutoff may reduce a group's actual output to zero, so a "
"planned quota is not an output guarantee."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:39
#: 324a565d406e44ec92d6f0e0ddbe6af0
msgid "用同一独立测试集比较 FPS 子集和等规模随机子集；如果关键结构类型本来不在候选池中，应回到上游补充，而不是继续调整 FPS。"
msgstr ""
"Compare the FPS subset with an equally sized random subset on the same independent "
"test set. If an important structure type is absent from the candidate pool, add it "
"upstream instead of continuing to tune FPS."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:41
#: 74fe518f453c46689db44fc8dc931254
msgid "参数说明"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:43
#: 4bac482cd3fa48028f65f6420398b7d0
msgid "描述符 NEP 模型（nep_path）"
msgstr "nep_path"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:45
#: 8b385f9e4ef745589794e42f014b191d
msgid "`str`，默认使用内置 `nep89.txt`。描述符距离由该模型决定；模型文件存在不等于一定覆盖候选元素，正式采样前应确认模型的化学体系。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, defaulting to the bundled `nep89.txt`. This model defines descriptor "
"distances. A model file's existence does not guarantee that it covers the candidate "
"elements; confirm its chemical system before production sampling."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:47
#: ef12185a9c3c4bcba55b6a36111f95d1
msgid "最大输出（n_samples）"
msgstr "Maximum Output (n_samples)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:49
#: ee6830f7e8ad4b7c86f3bd60ef832214
msgid "`int`，默认 `100`。本次最多保留的候选结构数。输入更少或距离阈值提前停止时，实际输出更少。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100`. Maximum number of candidate structures retained in this run. "
"The actual output is smaller when the input has fewer structures or the distance "
"cutoff stops selection early."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:51
#: ef84a435593e44668d76193a50b97185
msgid "距离阈值（min_distance）"
msgstr "Distance Cutoff (min_distance)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:53
#: 65773133bc7b4577bac60b0e9eca75b6
msgid "`float`，默认 `0`。无物理单位，尺度依赖 NEP 模型。`0` 表示只按数量停止；大于 `0` 时用于提前停止近重复选择。"
msgstr ""
"`float`, default `0`. It has no physical unit and its scale depends on the NEP model."
" `0` stops by count only; a positive value stops the selection of near-duplicates "
"early."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:55
#: 95c047ce929b41d7a2eb50d6f7a16df5
msgid "采样计划（strategy）"
msgstr "Sampling Plan (strategy)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:57
#: cde64e0e0388453cb6f205e8a82252db
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"global\"`："
msgstr "`str`, default `\"global\"`:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md
#: 17b89e6c3cd34cd1ab5fe4c6b2176a23
msgid "值"
msgstr "Value"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md
#: 06891280eb574b79bbd2d55f76d31d5b
msgid "界面名称"
msgstr "Interface label"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md
#: e73ec61fe6bb4a2d9e5cacd9faf375eb
msgid "行为"
msgstr "Behavior"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md
#: b0020bef08e2415bb4377cb3f8271c9f
msgid "`global`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md
#: aefa71471db346a28f832e8e174ef1ab
msgid "全局预算"
msgstr "Global budget"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md
#: 6d07ece84aa14f99b190dec26fba6531
msgid "全部候选共享一个预算；没有已有训练集时从输入第 1 帧开始"
msgstr ""
"All candidates share one budget; without an existing training set, selection starts "
"from the first input frame"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md
#: 804624de09c34d7ea75810eddd2dadc0
msgid "`element_set`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md
#: 9e1d4481214547eb8806cf214d6df59d
msgid "按元素集合均衡"
msgstr "Balance by element set"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md
#: 166730ed7f724f10b892c1a28cdfd500
msgid "每组先计划一个名额，其余按组大小平方根分配；组内从描述符中心开始"
msgstr ""
"Plan one slot for each group first, then allocate the remainder in proportion to the "
"square root of group size; within each group, start from the descriptor center"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:64
#: adc916cccea04cf2abde3a124b004209
msgid "当最大输出小于元素集合数时，均衡模式会明确报错。计划名额仍会受到已有覆盖和距离阈值影响。"
msgstr ""
"Balanced mode reports an explicit error when maximum output is smaller than the "
"number of element sets. Planned quotas are still affected by existing coverage and "
"the distance cutoff."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:66
#: a00265dae030451fbd5037b75b888554
msgid "已有训练集（existing_dataset_path）"
msgstr "Existing Training Set (existing_dataset_path)"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:68
#: fd9c14cb7de64702a910ecda57c77236
msgid ""
"`str`，默认空。选择一个 `.xyz` 或 `.extxyz` "
"训练集作为补选起点。全局模式从全部已有结构的覆盖范围继续选；均衡模式只以元素集合相同的已有结构为起点。输出只包含本轮新选中的候选，不重复包含已有训练集。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, empty by default. Select an `.xyz` or `.extxyz` training set as the starting "
"coverage for supplementary selection. Global mode continues from the coverage of all "
"existing structures; balanced mode starts only from existing structures with the same"
" element set. The output contains only candidates newly selected in this run and does"
" not repeat the existing training set."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:70
#: 0b533c1b4fa84f9583b333452bf90f2b
msgid "计算后端（backend）"
msgstr "backend"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:72
#: 0049cae6a5ee44f6a8a8ab2d013cf1a8
msgid "`str`，默认 `\"auto\"`。由全局 NEP 计算设置管理，卡片界面不单独暴露；旧 JSON 中的值仍会恢复。"
msgstr ""
"`str`, default `\"auto\"`. Managed by the global NEP compute settings and not exposed"
" separately in the card interface; values from legacy JSON are still restored."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:74
#: 7cffd7209ed14125a5663fd64c439599
msgid "单批最大原子数（chunk_max_atoms）"
msgstr "chunk_max_atoms"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:76
#: cbd0a658b7c94ccf9bda8547b13bec31
msgid "`int`，默认 `100000`。描述符计算的内存分块参数，由全局设置管理，不改变 FPS 选择规则。"
msgstr ""
"`int`, default `100000`. Memory-chunking parameter for descriptor calculation, "
"managed by global settings. It does not change the FPS selection rule."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:78
#: 01b7283e74a947abb07888a12b8ac579
msgid "推荐组合"
msgstr "Recommended combinations"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:80
#: 5f63eab2f3914841a72fd283c8d54e10
msgid "生成或扰动卡 → `Geometry Filter` → `FPS Filter`"
msgstr "Generation or perturbation card → `Geometry Filter` → `FPS Filter`"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:81
#: a83738135c4343529c6665d1c0afcc7c
msgid "多分支汇总 → `FPS Filter` → 导出 DFT"
msgstr "Merge multiple branches → `FPS Filter` → export for DFT"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:83
#: 6a1ec7bcbbe14e4f9982c6e25c465b4e
msgid "常见问题"
msgstr "Troubleshooting"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:85
#: 9e4433755b0549ad9b5f9b961f8a11db
msgid "**为什么输出少于最大值？** 输入数量不足，或距离阈值让选择提前停止。查看预览中的阈值状态和运行后的实际输出。"
msgstr ""
"**Why is the output smaller than the maximum?** The input contains fewer structures, "
"or the distance cutoff stopped selection early. Check the cutoff status in the "
"preview and the actual output after the run."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:87
#: b3199372b2fe49509764fe8fc4f966b1
msgid "**为什么均衡模式某组输出为 0？** 计划名额不是强制输出。已有训练集已经覆盖该组、同时启用距离阈值时，组内候选可能全部被判为过近。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does a group produce zero output in balanced mode?** A planned quota is not "
"mandatory output. If the existing training set already covers the group and a "
"distance cutoff is enabled, every candidate in that group may be considered too "
"close."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:89
#: 3ca56895978e4febaa4c5f972eb7c834
msgid "**为什么换模型后结果不同？** FPS 距离定义在模型产生的描述符空间中。不同模型对结构差异的表达不同。"
msgstr ""
"**Why does changing the model change the result?** FPS distance is defined in the "
"descriptor space produced by the model. Different models represent structural "
"differences differently."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:91
#: cead5fc7d4fc4344bdf6ebc0d5c7be91
msgid "输出标签"
msgstr "Output labels"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:93
#: 104448cd506e49778973115a7fc4fc4c
msgid "输出保留原有 `Config_type`。全局模式按 FPS 选择顺序输出；按元素集合均衡模式保持入选帧在输入中的相对顺序。"
msgstr ""
"The output preserves the original `Config_type`. Global mode outputs structures in "
"FPS selection order; element-set balanced mode preserves the selected frames' "
"relative order in the input."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:95
#: 41212fac47cd424bbe66a95267edd4bd
msgid "可复现性"
msgstr "Reproducibility"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/cards/fps-filter-card.md:97
#: 3bafa1fb95244f2b881cd83218257c1d
msgid "本卡没有随机性。同一输入、模型和参数会得到相同结果；改变输入顺序可能改变全局模式的起点和选择顺序。"
msgstr ""
"This card has no randomness. The same input, model, and parameters produce the same "
"result. Changing input order may change the starting point and selection order in "
"global mode."

#~ msgid "FPS 过滤（FPS Filter）"
#~ msgstr "FPS Filter"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "基于结构级 NEP 均值描述符执行最远点采样（FPS），从大批量结构中挑选代表性子集。需要提供一个 NEP "
#~ "模型文件（如内置的 `nep89.txt` 或你自己训练的模型）用于生成描述符。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Run farthest-point sampling (FPS) on "
#~ "structure-level mean NEP descriptors to select"
#~ " a representative subset from a large "
#~ "structure pool. Provide a NEP model file, "
#~ "such as the bundled `nep89.txt` or your "
#~ "own trained model, to generate descriptors."

#~ msgid "`global`：兼容原有行为，对全部结构执行一次全局 FPS；"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`global`: preserves the original behavior and "
#~ "runs one global FPS pass over all "
#~ "structures;"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "**参数设置：** `strategy=\"global\"`，`nep_path` 指向 NEP "
#~ "模型，`n_samples=200`，`min_distance=0.01`。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Parameters:** set `strategy=\"global\"`, point "
#~ "`nep_path` to a NEP model, use "
#~ "`n_samples=200`, and set `min_distance=0.01`."

#~ msgid "**输出：** 200 个结构，在描述符空间中两两距离尽可能大，覆盖输入集的多样性"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Output:** Up to 200 structures chosen to "
#~ "spread coverage through the input descriptor "
#~ "space."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "已有训练集可作为 warm "
#~ "start。只有元素集合相同的已有结构才参与候选距离初始化，卡片会优先选择当前训练集尚未覆盖的区域。已有训练集不计入 `n_samples` "
#~ "输出数量。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "An existing training set can be used as"
#~ " a warm start. Only existing structures "
#~ "with the same element set initialize candidate"
#~ " distances, so the card prioritizes regions "
#~ "not yet covered by the training set. "
#~ "Existing structures do not count toward the"
#~ " `n_samples` output."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认 `MISSING`。指向用于生成 NEP 描述符的模型文件，必须是一个可用的 NEP "
#~ "模型文件（如 `nep.txt` 或内置 `nep89.txt`）。路径为空或文件不存在时卡片直接报错。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`str`, default `MISSING`. Path to a usable "
#~ "NEP model such as `nep.txt` or bundled "
#~ "`nep89.txt`. The card fails if the path "
#~ "is empty or nonexistent."

#~ msgid "`int`，默认 100。FPS 过滤后保留的代表结构数。这是输出数量，不是上游生成数量——DFT 预算固定时直接设你计划算的上限；但设太小会把稀有构型也筛掉。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`int`, default `100`. Maximum representative "
#~ "outputs. It is an output count, not an"
#~ " upstream generation count. Match it to the"
#~ " DFT budget while leaving enough capacity "
#~ "for rare families."

#~ msgid "`float`，默认 0.01。描述符空间中的最小距离阈值。值越大去重越激进，但设太大 FPS 会过早停、选不够数；设太小又可能混入近重复结构。"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "`float`, default `0.01`. Minimum distance in "
#~ "descriptor space. Larger values deduplicate more "
#~ "aggressively but can stop before reaching the"
#~ " requested count; smaller values admit near-"
#~ "duplicates."

#~ msgid "兼容旧流程；全部结构执行一次全局 FPS，从输入索引 0 开始"
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "Preserves the legacy workflow; runs one global"
#~ " FPS pass over all structures starting from"
#~ " input index 0."

#~ msgid ""
#~ "`str`，默认空字符串。仅 `strategy=\"element_set\"` 使用。指向已有 `.xyz` 或"
#~ " `.extxyz` 训练集，作为同元素集合内的 warm "
