#~ "statistical redundancy: 200 random vacancies may "
#~ "represent only 15 distinct local environments. "
#~ "FPS greedily chooses points farthest from the"
#~ " selected set in descriptor space, preserving "
#~ "diversity while removing near-duplicates."

