#~ msgstr ""
#~ "**Descriptor calculation is slow.** Descriptor "
#~ "generation can take time for large batches."
#~ " `Maximum atoms per chunk` (`chunk_max_atoms`) "
#~ "controls the total atoms in one batch; "
#~ "it is not a chunked-sampling parameter "
#~ "for FPS. Reducing it lowers peak memory "
#~ "only and does not change the selection "
#~ "algorithm."

